{"seq":1,"slug":"alert-trigger-condition-model","title":"提醒触发条件建模：库存回补、价格阈值与变体粒度订阅","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/wishlist-restock-price-alert-engagement/restock-price-alert-engine/alert-trigger-condition-model","wordCount":2841,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"提醒触发条件建模-库存回补-价格阈值与变体粒度订阅\">提醒触发条件建模：库存回补、价格阈值与变体粒度订阅</h1><p>「到货提醒」真正难的地方不在通知发得出去，而在于<strong>判定该不该发</strong>。一个用户订阅的是「蓝色 / M 码」，系统收到的却是一连串每几十毫秒刷新一次的可售量和随时变动的价格。触发条件建模要回答三件事：谓词作用在哪个量上（可售还是可承诺）、在哪一层粒度上成立（商品还是变体）、以及如何在大促般的抖动中不重复打扰。本文把这三件事拆成可实现的判定结构。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>触发条件不是对「状态」的判断，而是对<strong>状态迁移的边沿</strong>的判断。用户点「到货提醒」时商品此刻不可售，系统要检测的是 <code>OutOfStock → InStock</code> 这条边沿，而不是「当前是否 InStock」这个电平。若写成电平判断，后台任务每轮扫描都会发现「现在有货」，在补齐库存的那几天里反复命中——这不是 bug，是模型选错了。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  S[订阅建立&lt;br/&gt;OUT_OF_STOCK] --&gt; W[等待事件]&#10;  W --&gt; C{边沿判定&lt;br/&gt;可售量跃过阈值}&#10;  C --&gt;|否| W&#10;  C --&gt;|是| G{闸门&lt;br/&gt;冷却 / 限频 / 去重}&#10;  G --&gt;|拦截| W&#10;  G --&gt;|放行| F[触发通知&lt;br/&gt;状态置 ARMED→SENT]&#10;  F --&gt; R[等待复位条件]&#10;  R --&gt;|回到阈值下方| S\">graph TD\n  S[订阅建立&lt;br/&gt;OUT_OF_STOCK] --&gt; W[等待事件]\n  W --&gt; C{边沿判定&lt;br/&gt;可售量跃过阈值}\n  C --&gt;|否| W\n  C --&gt;|是| G{闸门&lt;br/&gt;冷却 / 限频 / 去重}\n  G --&gt;|拦截| W\n  G --&gt;|放行| F[触发通知&lt;br/&gt;状态置 ARMED→SENT]\n  F --&gt; R[等待复位条件]\n  R --&gt;|回到阈值下方| S</pre><p>订阅对象本身也要建模成一个带生命周期的小状态机：<code>PENDING</code>（已订阅、未满足）、<code>ARMED</code>（条件接近触发）、<code>NOTIFIED</code>（已发过、冷却中）、<code>EXPIRED</code>（超窗或退订）。<code>NOTIFIED</code> 不是终态——价格提醒尤其需要<strong>复位</strong>：价格降到目标价以下发一次，之后只有当价格重新回到目标价之上，下一次下降才构成新的边沿。没有复位，订阅就变成一次性的。</p>\n<p>三类触发的判定对象、粒度与边沿来源各不相同，混在一张表里容易漏掉粒度问题：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>触发类型</th>\n<th>谓词作用的量</th>\n<th>典型粒度</th>\n<th>边沿信号来源</th>\n<th>复位条件</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>库存回补</td>\n<td>可承诺量 ATP</td>\n<td>SKU 变体 + 位置</td>\n<td>库存量变更事件</td>\n<td>再次跌破可售阈值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>降价提醒</td>\n<td>成交价 <code>price</code></td>\n<td>变体（或商品最低价）</td>\n<td>价格更新事件 / 定时抓取</td>\n<td>价格回升过目标价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>目标价达成</td>\n<td>相对折扣率</td>\n<td>变体</td>\n<td>同上，带百分比口径</td>\n<td>折扣率收窄</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>变体复活</td>\n<td>变体级可售性</td>\n<td>变体</td>\n<td>变体状态事件</td>\n<td>变体再次售罄</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表的关键列是<strong>粒度</strong>：库存回补天然是变体级 + 位置级的量（同一 SKU 在美东仓无货、美西仓有货），而降价提醒既可能按变体、也可能按「商品最低变体价」来订阅——两种口径下用户预期不同，必须在订阅时锁定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"库存回补触发-从可售量到可承诺量\">库存回补触发：从可售量到可承诺量</h2><p>库存回补的谓词看起来是 <code>available &gt; 0</code>，但真正可承诺的量是 ATP。Shopify 的库存模型把每个 (库存项, 位置) 拆成 <code>available</code>、<code>on_hand</code>、<code>incoming</code>、<code>committed</code> 等多个命名量，下单只改变状态分布而不改变 <code>on_hand</code>（来源：Shopify InventoryLevel 对象文档，<a href=\"https://shopify.dev/docs/api/admin-graphql/latest/objects/InventoryLevel）。这意味着\">https://shopify.dev/docs/api/admin-graphql/latest/objects/InventoryLevel）。这意味着</a> <code>available</code> 是唯一适合当判据的量：<code>incoming</code>（在途）绝不能触发通知——用户收到「有货了」点进去却发现要等两周到货，这是最伤信任的一类错误。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>fire</mtext><mtext>restock</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">[</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>A</mi><mi>T</mi><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>v</mi></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mtext>safe</mtext></msub><mtext> </mtext><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">]</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo>∧</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">[</mo><mtext> </mtext><mtext>state</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>PENDING</mtext><mtext> </mtext><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">]</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo>∧</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">[</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">¬</mi><mtext>cooldown</mtext><mtext> </mtext><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{fire}_{\\text{restock}} = \\bigl[\\,ATP_v &gt; \\theta_{\\text{safe}}\\,\\bigr] \\;\\land\\; \\bigl[\\,\\text{state} = \\text{PENDING}\\,\\bigr] \\;\\land\\; \\bigl[\\,\\neg\\text{cooldown}\\,\\bigr]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">fire</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">restock</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">[</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">safe</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">]</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">[</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">state</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">PENDING</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">]</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">[</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">¬</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cooldown</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>T</mi><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>v</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ATP_v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是变体 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span> 的可承诺量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mtext>safe</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_{\\text{safe}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">safe</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是安全阈值。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mtext>safe</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_{\\text{safe}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">safe</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 不该取 1：只补回 1 件货就向所有订阅者群发，结果绝大多数人点进来已售罄，反而制造投诉。常见做法是要求一次性补货超过排队订阅量的一定比例，或取一个绝对值下限。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  I[库存变更事件&lt;br/&gt;item + location + qty] --&gt; D{去重&lt;br/&gt;幂等键}&#10;  D --&gt; A[重算 ATP&lt;br/&gt;available − committed − buffer]&#10;  A --&gt; P{ATP &gt; 阈值 且&lt;br/&gt;此前为售罄?}&#10;  P --&gt;|否| X[忽略]&#10;  P --&gt;|是| Q[通知队列&lt;br/&gt;按订阅时间 FIFO]&#10;  Q --&gt; L{剩余 ATP 还够?}&#10;  L --&gt;|够| N[发送并递减配额]&#10;  L --&gt;|不够| H[保留为等待态]\">graph TD\n  I[库存变更事件&lt;br/&gt;item + location + qty] --&gt; D{去重&lt;br/&gt;幂等键}\n  D --&gt; A[重算 ATP&lt;br/&gt;available − committed − buffer]\n  A --&gt; P{ATP &gt; 阈值 且&lt;br/&gt;此前为售罄?}\n  P --&gt;|否| X[忽略]\n  P --&gt;|是| Q[通知队列&lt;br/&gt;按订阅时间 FIFO]\n  Q --&gt; L{剩余 ATP 还够?}\n  L --&gt;|够| N[发送并递减配额]\n  L --&gt;|不够| H[保留为等待态]</pre><p>事件来源上，主流平台提供的是库存量变更的订阅式通知（Shopify 的 <code>inventory_levels/update</code> 类事件），但<strong>事件不等于可发信号</strong>：它只说明「某个量变了」，是否跨越了你定义的阈值仍要自己算。位置维度也必须显式处理——若商家有多个履约位置，某位置售罄而另一位置有货时，前台是否算「有货」取决于是否开启跨位置履约，订阅判定必须和这个开关一致，否则会出现「通知了但买不到」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"价格阈值触发-绝对价-折扣率与货币口径\">价格阈值触发：绝对价、折扣率与货币口径</h2><p>降价提醒的谓词比库存多一层歧义：用户说的「降到我想要的价」到底是什么价。生产系统里必须把它收敛成一个确定的、可比较的量，常见三种口径——<strong>绝对目标价</strong>（<code>price ≤ 199.00</code>）、<strong>相对折扣率</strong>（<code>discount ≥ 20%</code>）、<strong>历史最低价突破</strong>（<code>price &lt; min(history)</code>）。三者对价格波动的敏感度完全不同，选错会要么过于沉默要么过度打扰。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>fire</mtext><mtext>price</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">[</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>target</mtext></msub><mtext> </mtext><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">]</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo>∧</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">[</mo><mtext> </mtext><mtext>in_stock</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>true</mtext><mtext> </mtext><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">]</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo>∧</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">[</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow></msub><mtext>  </mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>ϵ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{fire}_{\\text{price}} = \\bigl[\\,p_t \\le p_{\\text{target}}\\,\\bigr] \\;\\land\\; \\bigl[\\,\\text{in\\_stock} = \\text{true}\\,\\bigr] \\;\\land\\; \\bigl[\\,p_t &lt; p_{t-\\Delta}\\;-\\;\\epsilon\\,\\bigr]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">fire</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">price</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">[</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">target</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">]</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">[</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">in_stock</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">true</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">]</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">[</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7917em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>最后一项 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span> 是价格意义上的「最小有意义变化」：没有它，分币级抖动、四舍五入或货币换算的舍入误差都会凑成一次「降价」边沿。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>in_stock</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{in\\_stock}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">in_stock</span></span></span></span></span></span> 最容易被漏掉——价格达标但商品无货的提醒几乎无价值，应等待有货再发，或与库存回补条件合并。</p>\n<p>跨境场景下价格还有两个必须显式化的坑。其一是<strong>货币</strong>：同一件商品在不同站点以不同货币展示，阈值必须锁定订阅时的展示货币并记录换算率口径，否则汇率一动，用本币定义的「目标价」在他币站点上就不再等价。其二是<strong>促销价的临时性</strong>：大促期间的划线价（<code>compare_at_price</code>）与结算价（<code>price</code>）不是一回事，用户订阅的是结算价，判定若误用划线价，会把「原价从未变过」误判为「降价 30%」。行业口径也区分两者——Google Merchant Center 商品数据规范用 <code>price</code> 表示当前售价、<code>sale_price</code> 表示促销价（来源：<a href=\"https://support.google.com/merchants/answer/7052112）。\">https://support.google.com/merchants/answer/7052112）。</a></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>价格口径</th>\n<th>判定表达式</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>绝对目标价</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>target</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_t \\le p_{\\text{target}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8304em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">target</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>用户预期最明确</td>\n<td>汇率/成本变动后目标价失真</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>折扣率</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>base</mtext></msub><mo>≥</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1 - p_t/p_{\\text{base}} \\ge r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">base</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>跨币种、跨价格档通用</td>\n<td>依赖可靠的基准价 <code>base</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>历史最低</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_t &lt; \\min_{s&lt;t} p_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8623em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1774em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>天然稀缺感、转化好</td>\n<td>冷启动无历史、易被一次性清仓价打崩</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"变体粒度订阅与订阅的生命周期\">变体粒度订阅与订阅的生命周期</h2><p>「到货提醒」的用户痛点八成出在变体粒度上。用户想买「黑色 / 42 码」，商品页判断「是否可售」却常常只能看到「商品至少有一个变体有货」。若订阅建在商品层，红色补货会通知所有订阅黑色的人——既是打扰，也直接毁掉信任。正确做法是<strong>订阅锚定到变体</strong>，<strong>展示锚点可在商品层</strong>：订阅时同时记录 <code>product_id</code> 与 <code>variant_id</code>，判定在变体上做，商品层的「全部售罄 / 部分有货」用于页面提示。</p>\n<p>变体粒度带来一个建模难点：<strong>变体现已不存在或永久停产</strong>。用户订阅的 <code>variant_id</code> 可能被下架、被合并到新变体，或该变体因停产而永远不会回补。订阅状态机需要一个 <code>INVALIDATED</code> 终态，并在变体消失时把订阅迁移到同商品的其他变体或通知用户，而不是让它永远挂在 <code>PENDING</code> 里堆积。这与商品可用性词汇表本身的分层一致——schema.org 用 <code>ItemAvailability</code> 枚举区分 <code>InStock</code> / <code>OutOfStock</code> / <code>PreOrder</code> / <code>BackOrder</code> 等状态（来源：<a href=\"https://schema.org/ItemAvailability），其中\">https://schema.org/ItemAvailability），其中</a> <code>BackOrder</code> 与 <code>PreOrder</code> 语义上「可下单但非现货」，不应触发「现货到货」类通知，必须从回补判定里排除。</p>\n<p>订阅还要回答「会不会过期」。无限期订阅会让一年的库存波动把老订阅不断唤醒，低转化的订阅持续消耗发送配额。常见策略是设定有效窗口（如 60 或 90 天），到期后转 <code>EXPIRED</code> 并可发一封再确认，让有意图的订阅优先拿到有限库存。</p>\n<h2 id=\"触发去抖-滞后与合并\">触发去抖、滞后与合并</h2><p>同一个边沿在真实系统里会重复到达。以库存为例：正向补货、逆向拣货、盘点修正、跨仓调拨、订单占用，都会让 <code>available</code> 在阈值上下反复穿越；若每个穿越都触发一次，一个补货日就能给同一用户发十几封邮件。去抖要做三层，缺一不可：<strong>时间窗去抖</strong>（两个边沿在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 内只算一次）、<strong>订阅级冷却</strong>（触发后进入 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>cool</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{cool}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cool</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 冷却）、<strong>用户级限频</strong>（跨订阅的每日发送预算上限）。</p>\n<p>滞后（hysteresis）解决的是<strong>阈值附近的抖振</strong>。若触发与复位阈值取同一个数，价格在目标价上下浮动 0.01 就会不断「触发—复位—再触发」。稳定做法是把两个阈值分开，触发取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>target</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p \\le p_{\\text{target}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8304em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">target</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，复位取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>target</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p \\ge p_{\\text{target}}(1 + h)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8304em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">target</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span> 为滞后带。这与工业控制里的施密特触发器同源，也解释了为什么库存的安全量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mtext>safe</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_{\\text{safe}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">safe</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与复位阈值应当不同——复位应要求更大幅度的回补。</p>\n<p>合并则是<strong>同一时机、同一用户的多个触发条件</strong>收敛成一封通知。用户同时订阅了「到货」和「降价」，两者在同一分钟成立时分别发两封是明显的打扰。合并规则应定义优先级与合并窗口：在窗口内采集所有成立的触发条件，按价值排序，只发一封并注明同时满足的条件。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>去抖层次</th>\n<th>作用范围</th>\n<th>典型参数</th>\n<th>失控后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时间窗去抖</td>\n<td>单次边沿</td>\n<td>秒级窗口</td>\n<td>重复边沿当成多次触发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>订阅级冷却</td>\n<td>单个订阅</td>\n<td>小时至天级</td>\n<td>同一用户被反复打扰</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用户级限频</td>\n<td>整个账户</td>\n<td>日发送预算</td>\n<td>活跃用户被自己订阅淹没</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>滞后带</td>\n<td>阈值判定</td>\n<td>触发/复位阈值分离</td>\n<td>阈值附近反复触发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合并窗口</td>\n<td>多条件</td>\n<td>分钟级窗口</td>\n<td>同刻多条件各发一封</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>触发判定作用在<strong>状态迁移的边沿</strong>上，不是当前电平；订阅是一条含 <code>PENDING / ARMED / NOTIFIED / EXPIRED</code>（以及 <code>INVALIDATED</code>）的状态机，且必须定义复位条件，否则降价提醒会退化成一次性通知。</li>\n<li>库存回补要用<strong>可承诺量 ATP 而非 <code>available</code> 或 <code>on_hand</code></strong>；<code>incoming</code>（在途）与 <code>BackOrder</code> / <code>PreOrder</code> 语义上不算现货，必须从回补判定里排除。Shopify 的库存量被拆成多个命名量、下单只改变状态分布（来源：<a href=\"https://shopify.dev/docs/api/admin-graphql/latest/objects/InventoryLevel）。\">https://shopify.dev/docs/api/admin-graphql/latest/objects/InventoryLevel）。</a></li>\n<li>价格阈值要先锁定口径（绝对价 / 折扣率 / 历史最低），并要求一个最小有意义变化 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span>，且必须与「有货」联合判定；跨境场景要显式处理货币与促销价（来源：<a href=\"https://support.google.com/merchants/answer/7052112）。\">https://support.google.com/merchants/answer/7052112）。</a></li>\n<li>订阅锚定到<strong>变体</strong>（同时记录商品），判定在变体上做；变体下架或停产要进 <code>INVALIDATED</code> 终态，不能永久滞留 <code>PENDING</code>。</li>\n<li>去抖要三层齐备（时间窗 / 订阅冷却 / 用户限频），阈值附近需要<strong>滞后带</strong>分离触发与复位阈值，同一用户的多条件触发要按窗口<strong>合并</strong>成一封。</li>\n<li>本文只处理「该不该发」的判定结构；判定通过后如何送达见 <a href=\"../notification-delivery-realtime/\">通知投递与实时通道</a>，订阅实体本身如何建模见 <a href=\"../wishlist-entity-catalog-model/\">心愿单实体与目录模型</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"提醒触发条件建模：库存回补、价格阈值与变体粒度订阅","id":"提醒触发条件建模-库存回补-价格阈值与变体粒度订阅"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"库存回补触发：从可售量到可承诺量","id":"库存回补触发-从可售量到可承诺量"},{"level":2,"text":"价格阈值触发：绝对价、折扣率与货币口径","id":"价格阈值触发-绝对价-折扣率与货币口径"},{"level":2,"text":"变体粒度订阅与订阅的生命周期","id":"变体粒度订阅与订阅的生命周期"},{"level":2,"text":"触发去抖、滞后与合并","id":"触发去抖-滞后与合并"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"心愿单分享、公开可见性与隐私合规（删除权与明文治理）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/wishlist-restock-price-alert-engagement/wishlist-entity-catalog-model/wishlist-share-visibility-privacy"},"next":{"title":"价格采集、降价检测与调度去抖机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/wishlist-restock-price-alert-engagement/restock-price-alert-engine/price-capture-drop-detection-scheduler"}}